export anchor FloorPlanStyle:
    number: 377
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Floor plan
    idea: The home is drawn as a dark blueprint floor plan, each room filled by its state with its own hatch or dot pattern and glyph, framed by a drawing title block, a room schedule and a plotted load graph.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #0a1a2f, blueprint ground
        grid: #12294a, 24px paper grid
        panel: #0d2038, idle rooms, fields, secondary buttons
        line: #8fb8e8, walls, frame, section heads
        faint: #2a4a74, table rules and dashed scene boxes
        ink: #e3eeff, text, plot line, primary button
        mute: #9fb6d6, labels and axis text
        onLine: #06152a, text on the ink button
        lit: #ffd27a, lights on bands, active scene, focus ring
        heat: #ff9f7a, heating hatch
        move: #c3b2ff, motion dots and rings
        safe: #7fe3b4, locked door
        alarm: #ff8f8f, open garage cross hatch and alert
    type:
        Monospace for everything, ui-monospace, SF Mono, Cascadia Mono,
        Roboto Mono, Menlo, base 14px at 1.5. Headings use a condensed
        stack, Arial Narrow, Roboto Condensed, Helvetica Neue, at 700 in
        caps with 0.12 to 0.14em tracking. Plan room labels 15px at 700
        caps, table text 12px, figures 20px at 600.
    layout:
        A navy blueprint page with a 24px paper grid holds one drawing sheet
        framed by a 2px pale blue border and a thin outer offset line. A
        title bar names Brightwork Home and Level 0 plan view with the day
        and time. A red and maroon striped alert strip reads Alert G1 with
        the garage sentence and an ink coloured Close now. The body splits
        into the plan and a 340px side column. The plan is an SVG floor plan
        with 4px walls, door swing arcs and a dimension line. Each room is
        filled by state with its own pattern and glyph, warm diagonal bands
        and bulbs for the lit living room, a plain fill and dash circle for
        the dark kitchen, a fine hatch and flame for the bedroom schedule, a
        red cross hatch and triangle for the garage with its door drawn
        swung open, and a violet dot field with rings for garden motion
        around the house. The front door sits in the hall with a green lock.
        Room labels sit on dark plates. A key legend under the plan names
        every pattern. The side column holds a title block table, an energy
        block with three ruled figure cells and a plotted step line on a
        grid with the peak circled, and scenes as dashed boxes with Movie
        solid yellow and checked. A full room schedule table with refs R1 to
        G1 spans the bottom. Below 1000px the side column drops under the
        plan, and at phone width the plan keeps a 600px minimum inside its
        own sideways scroll.
    spacing: An 8px unit on a 24px grid. 12 to 16px cell padding.
    density: High. Plan, title block, plot, scenes and a full schedule table in one sheet.
    corners: Square everywhere. No radius.
    borders: A 2px drawing frame with a 1px outer offset line, 1px faint cell rules in #2a4a74 and 4px walls.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from hatch and dot fills only.
    icons:
        Square capped line glyphs at 1.5 stroke in plan rooms and table
        cells. Each state pairs a fill pattern with a glyph and a word.
    focus: A 2px ink outline plus a yellow ring outside a dark gap.
    tone: Drawing office caps with refs, such as R1, G1, Alert G1 and Title block.
